    "sub_name": "奈米紡織科技",
    "sub_ename": "NANO TEXTILES TECHNOLOGY",
    "describe_ch": "教導學生了解奈米科技中的基本概念，並在工業上之應用。使學生了解奈米科技與傳統紡織工程相結合所能產生之新性能，並讓學生思考及活用其功能性紡織品，進而能夠應用於紡織工程之領域，提昇學生之研究水準。",
    "describe_eh": "Make  students realize the basic concept  of nanotechnology  and textile properties in the field of textile engineering. Furthermore，introduce students to know what a new technology can bring for textiles and lead the students to think over and use these technology in the applications of textiles .",
